eloquence-suite (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Eloquence Suite for Eloquence OS.
  * Added elovirt, elofind, elooffice, and eloapps packages.
  * Multi-architecture support for x86_64 (amd64) and ARM64 (aarch64).

